e,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":961,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_wellness_03","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_wellness_03_q2","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.1","itemType":"select_all","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"generate_solutions","stemPathEn":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.1.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.1.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[98,120],"terminalOffsetsZh":[22,31],"fullStemEn":"Which dietary strategies should the nurse suggest that are practical for the client's occupation? Select all that apply.","fullStemZh":"护士应建议哪些适合该患者职业的实用饮食策略？请选择所有适用项。","terminalSentenceEn":"Select all that apply.","terminalSentenceZh":"请选择所有适用项。","penultimateSentenceEn":"Which dietary strategies should the nurse suggest that are practical for the client's occupation?","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士应建议哪些适合该患者职业的实用饮食策略？","responseContext":{"type":"select_all","options":[{"id":"o5","en":"Eat only one large meal at the end of the driving shift.","zh":"只在驾驶班次结束时吃一顿大餐。"},{"id":"o1","en":"Pack a cooler with fresh vegetables and lean protein sandwiches.","zh":"带一个装有新鲜蔬菜和瘦肉三明治的冷藏箱。"},{"id":"o3","en":"Fast completely during 12-hour shifts to rapidly lower blood sugar.","zh":"在12小时的轮班期间完全禁食，以快速降低血糖。"},{"id":"o4","en":"Drink water or unsweetened tea instead of regular soda.","zh":"喝水或无糖茶代替普通汽水。"},{"id":"o2","en":"Choose salads with grilled chicken at fast food stops.","zh":"在快餐店选择搭配烤鸡肉的沙拉。"}],"correct":["o1","o2","o4"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Practical strategies must fit his environment. Packing a cooler, making better choices at fast food places, and eliminating sugary drinks are realistic and effective.","rationaleCorrectZh":"实用的策略必须适应他的环境。准备冷藏箱、在快餐店做出更好的选择以及戒除含糖饮料是现实且有效的。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Select interventions that are both medically appropriate and realistic for the client's constraints.","testTakingStrategyZh":"选择既符合医学要求又适合患者限制条件的干预措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":962,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_wellness_03","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_wellness_03_q3","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.2","itemType":"ordered_response","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"take_action","stemPathEn":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.760.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[79,116],"terminalOffsetsZh":[19,32],"fullStemEn":"The nurse is teaching the client how to perform a self-assessment of his feet. Place the steps in the correct order.","fullStemZh":"护士正在教导患者如何进行足部自我检查。请将步骤按正确的顺序排列。","terminalSentenceEn":"Place the steps in the correct order.","terminalSentenceZh":"请将步骤按正确的顺序排列。","penultimateSentenceEn":"The nurse is teaching the client how to perform a self-assessment of his feet.","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士正在教导患者如何进行足部自我检查。","responseContext":{"type":"ordered_response","options":[{"id":"o4","en":"Check between the toes for maceration or cracking.","zh":"检查脚趾间是否有浸渍或皲裂。"},{"id":"o3","en":"Inspect the tops and bottoms of the feet, using a mirror if necessary.","zh":"检查足部上方和足底，必要时使用镜子。"},{"id":"o5","en":"Document any cuts, blisters, or redness and notify the provider.","zh":"记录任何割伤、水泡或发红，并通知医生。"},{"id":"o1","en":"Wash hands thoroughly.","zh":"彻底洗手。"},{"id":"o2","en":"Remove shoes and socks in a well-lit area.","zh":"在光线充足的地方脱下鞋袜。"}],"correct":["o1","o2","o3","o4","o5"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Proper foot care requires hand hygiene first, exposing the feet in good light, inspecting broad areas, inspecting hidden areas (between toes), and finally documenting/reporting findings.","rationaleCorrectZh":"正确的足部护理需要先进行手部卫生，在光线良好的情况下露出双脚，检查大面积区域，检查隐蔽区域（脚趾间），最后记录/报告发现。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Follow the nursing process: prepare, general assessment, specific assessment, then act/document.","testTakingStrategyZh":"遵循护理程序：准备、一般评估、具体评估，然后行动/记录。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
