血糖控制得到改善。在休息站增加体育锻炼表明了行为的改变。然而，停滞的BMI表明体重管理策略需要进一步调整。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Evaluate objective data against standard clinical goals for diabetes and obesity.","testTakingStrategyZh":"根据糖尿病和肥胖症的标准临床目标评估客观数据。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":964,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_CASE_CONTAINER","questionPath":"questions.761","itemType":"case_study","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.761.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.761.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[0,97],"terminalOffsetsZh":[0,29],"fullStemEn":"Primary Care Visit A 45-year-old female presents to the clinic stating, 'I want to stop smoking.'","fullStemZh":"初级保健随访 一名45岁女性来到诊所，表示：“我想戒烟。”","terminalSentenceEn":"Primary Care Visit A 45-year-old female presents to the clinic stating, 'I want to stop smoking.'","terminalSentenceZh":"初级保健随访 一名45岁女性来到诊所，表示：“我想戒烟。”","penultimateSentenceEn":null,"penultimateSentenceZh":null,"responseContext":{},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Effective smoking cessation requires assessing readiness, understanding triggers, utilizing evidence-based pharmacotherapy, and planning for barriers like weight gain.","rationaleCorrectZh":"有效的戒烟需要评估准备情况、了解诱因、利用循证药物治疗以及制定应对体重增加等障碍的计划。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Focus on the transtheoretical model of change and holistic support.","testTakingStrategyZh":"关注改变的跨理论模型和整体支持。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":965,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04_q1","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.0","itemType":"multiple_choice","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"recognize_cues","stemPathEn":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.0.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.0.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[0,96],"terminalOffsetsZh":[0,26],"fullStemEn":"Which statement by the client best indicates readiness for change in the transtheoretical model?","fullStemZh":"患者的哪句话最能表明在跨理论模型中已做好改变的准备？","terminalSentenceEn":"Which statement by the client best indicates readiness for change in the transtheoretical model?","terminalSentenceZh":"患者的哪句话最能表明在跨理论模型中已做好改变的准备？","penultimateSentenceEn":null,"penultimateSentenceZh":null,"responseContext":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"o4","en":"'My doctor told me I have to quit because of my birth control pills.'","zh":"“我的医生告诉我，因为我吃避孕药所以必须戒烟。”"},{"id":"o1","en":"'I know smoking is bad, but it's the only way I handle stress.'","zh":"“我知道吸烟不好，但这是我应对压力的唯一方法。”"},{"id":"o3","en":"'I might try to cut down next year when my work calms down.'","zh":"“如果明年工作没那么忙了，我可能会尝试减少吸烟量。”"},{"id":"o2","en":"'I am planning to throw away my cigarettes this Sunday and start using the gum.'","zh":"“我打算这个星期天把烟扔掉，开始嚼口香糖。”"}],"correct":["o2"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Setting a specific quit date and having a concrete plan indicates the 'Preparation' stage, showing true readiness to act.","rationaleCorrectZh":"设定具体的戒烟日期并有具体的计划，表明处于“准备”阶段，显示出真正准备好采取行动。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Look for action-oriented planning, which indicates a higher level of readiness.","testTakingStrategyZh":"寻找以行动为导向的计划，这表明准备程度较高。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":966,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04_q2","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.1","itemType":"matrix","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"analyze_cues","stemPathEn":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.1.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.1.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[0,98],"terminalOffsetsZh":[0,27],"fullStemEn":"Click to specify whether each factor increases or decreases the client's risk for smoking relapse.","fullStemZh":"点击指出以下各个因素是增加还是降低了该患者复吸的风险。","terminalSentenceEn":"Click to specify whether each factor increases or decreases the client's risk for smoking relapse.","terminalSentenceZh":"点击指出以下各个因素是增加还是降低了该患者复吸的风险。","penultimateSentenceEn":null,"penultimateSentenceZh":null,"responseContext":{"type":"matrix","matrix":{"rows":[{"id":"r1","en":"High stress work environment","zh":"高压力的工作环境"},{"id":"r2","en":"Has identified specific triggers and developed coping strategies","zh":"已识别出具体诱因并制定了应对策略"},{"id":"r3","en":"Dependence on nicotine as a coping mechanism","zh":"依赖尼古丁作为应对机制"}],"columns":[{"id":"c2","en":"Decreases Risk","zh":"降低风险"},{"id":"c1","en":"Increases Risk","zh":"增加风险"}],"selectionMode":"single_per_row"},"correct":[{"rowId":"r1","columnIds":["c1"]},{"rowId":"r2","columnIds":["c2"]},{"rowId":"r3","columnIds":["c1"]}]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Stress and poor coping mechanisms increase relapse risk. This client has already identified stress as her trigger and sought help, which directly reduces the circumstances that led to prior relapses.","rationaleCorrectZh":"压力和不良的应对机制会增加复吸风险。该患者已明确压力为诱因并主动寻求帮助，这直接降低了以往导致复吸的诱发情境。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Identify which factors in the exhibit directly support or undermine this client's quit plan; concrete coping strategies are protective, while identified triggers without a plan are risks.","testTakingStrategyZh":"从病历中识别哪些因素直接支持或削弱该患者的戒烟计划；有具体应对策略是保护性因素，而有诱因却无应对计划则是风险。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":967,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04_q3","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.2","itemType":"select_all","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"generate_solutions","stemPathEn":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[123,145],"terminalOffsetsZh":[28,37],"fullStemEn":"The nurse is discussing pharmacological options with the client. Which options should the nurse include in the discussion? Select all that apply.","fullStemZh":"护士正在与患者讨论药物选择。护士应在讨论中包括哪些选项？请选择所有适用项。","terminalSentenceEn":"Select all that apply.","terminalSentenceZh":"请选择所有适用项。","penultimateSentenceEn":"Which options should the nurse include in the discussion?","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士应在讨论中包括哪些选项？","responseContext":{"type":"select_all","options":[{"id":"o2","en":"Varenicline","zh":"伐尼克兰 (Varenicline)"},{"id":"o5","en":"Nicotine replacement lozenges","zh":"尼古丁替代含片"},{"id":"o4","en":"E-cigarettes (vaping)","zh":"电子烟"},{"id":"o1","en":"Nicotine replacement gum","zh":"尼古丁替代口香糖"},{"id":"o3","en":"Bupropion","zh":"安非他酮 (Bupropion)"}],"correct":["o1","o2","o3","o5"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"FDA-approved medications for smoking cessation include NRT (gum, lozenges, patches), varenicline, and bupropion. E-cigarettes are not approved or recommended for cessation.","rationaleCorrectZh":"FDA批准的戒烟药物包括尼古丁替代疗法(NRT)（口香糖、含片、贴片）、伐尼克兰和安非他酮。电子烟未被批准也不被推荐用于戒烟。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Differentiate evidence-based medical therapies from unapproved consumer products.","testTakingStrategyZh":"区分循证医学疗法和未经批准的消费产品。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":968,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04","embeddedQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_smoking_04_q4","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.3","itemType":"multiple_choice","category":"Health Promotion and Maintenance","topic":"Chronic Disease Management & Lifestyle","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":"take_action","stemPathEn":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.3.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.761.caseStudy.questions.3.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[78,128],"terminalOffsetsZh":[14,28],"fullStemEn":"The client expresses concern that if she quits smoking, she will gain weight. What is the nurse's most appropriate intervention?","fullStemZh":"患者担心如果戒烟体重会增加。护士最恰当的干预措施是什么？","terminalSentenceEn":"What is the nurse's most appropriate intervention?","terminalSentenceZh":"护士最恰当的干预措施是什么？","penultimateSentenceEn":"The client expresses concern that if she quits smoking, she will gain weight.","penultimateSentenceZh":"患者担心如果戒烟体重会增加。","responseContext":{"type":"multiple_choice","options":[{"id":"o3","en":"Acknowledge that mild weight gain is common and focus the plan on keeping her hands and mouth busy with healthy snacks.","zh":"承认轻微的体重增加很常见，并将计划的重点放在用健康的零食让她的手和嘴保持忙碌。"},{"id":"o1","en":"Reassure her that weight gain is a myth and will not happen.","zh":"向她保证体重增加是一种迷思，并不会发生。"},{"id":"o2","en":"Advise her to start a strict low-calorie diet on the same day she quits smoking.","zh":"建议她在戒烟的同一天开始严格的低热量饮食。"},{"id":"o4","en":"Tell her to delay quitting until she has lost 10 pounds.","zh":"告诉她推迟戒烟，直到她减掉10磅。"}],"correct":["o3"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Weight gain is a common reality due to metabolic changes and substituting food for cigarettes. Acknowledging this and providing healthy alternatives is the best approach. Too many strict changes at once (like a strict diet) can lead to failure.","rationaleCorrectZh":"由于代谢变化和用食物代替香烟，体重增加是一个普遍的现实。承认这一点并提供健康的替代品是最好的方法。同时进行太多严格的改变（如严格节食）可能会导致失败。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Prioritize interventions that are honest, realistic, and support the primary goal without overwhelming the client.","testTakingStrategyZh":"优先考虑诚实、现实并在不压垮患者的情况下支持主要目标的干预措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":969,"bankPath":"banks/gemini-canonical.json","bankSha256":"8259ffb6b12c5b3ba267566b8247207ec4fc573d536d9f78fafd5d18655b63c3","topLevelQuestionId":"gemini_gapfill_case_2026_06_10_case_sleep_05","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_CASE_CONTAINER","questionPath":"questions.762","itemType":"case_study","category":"Basic Care and Comfort","topic":"Sleep & Rest","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.762.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.762.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[0,89],"terminalOffsetsZh":[0,28],"fullStemEn":"Long-Term Care Facility A 78-year-old male resident reports difficulty sleeping at night.","fullStemZh":"长期护理机构 一名78岁男性养老院居民自述夜间睡眠困难。","terminalSentenceEn":"Long-Term Care Facility A 78-year-old male resident reports difficulty sleeping at night.","terminalSentenceZh":"长期护理机构 一名78岁男性养老院居民自述夜间睡眠困难。","penultimateSentenceEn":null,"penultimateSentenceZh":null,"responseContext":{},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Sleep promotion in the elderly relies on establishing healthy sleep hygiene, modifying the environment, and avoiding stimulating substances or activities near bedtime.","rationaleCorrectZh":"老年人的睡眠促进依赖于建立健康的睡眠卫生习惯、改善环境以及避免在睡前进行刺激性的物质摄入或活动。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Focus on non-pharmacologic interventions for sleep hygiene.","testTakingStrategyZh":"关注针对睡眠卫生的非药物干预措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
