s should be turned off.","rationaleCorrectZh":"非药物的睡眠卫生干预是一线治疗方案。镇静催眠药会增加老年人的跌倒风险。应关闭屏幕。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Prioritize safe, non-pharmacologic sleep hygiene interventions for older adults.","testTakingStrategyZh":"优先考虑对老年人安全、非药物的睡眠卫生干预措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
