/support, and preservation of the client's abilities.","rationaleCorrectZh":"有效的家庭适应包括喘息服务、现实的任务分担、教育/支持以及维持患者能力。","testTakingStrategyEn":"For caregiver burden, pick interventions that distribute care and preserve relationships.","testTakingStrategyZh":"处理照护者负担时，选择能分担照护并维护关系的措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
