 with real follow-up data before changing it.","testTakingStrategyZh":"评价结果类题目中，改变计划前先用真实随访数据与计划对照。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
