mmobility, moisture, poor intake, low albumin, and bony prominence redness increase risk. A written turning schedule supports prevention.","rationaleCorrectZh":"不能自行移动、潮湿、摄入差、白蛋白低以及骨突处发红会增加风险。书面翻身计划支持预防。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Pressure injury risk is driven by pressure duration, tissue tolerance, moisture, nutrition, and mobility.","testTakingStrategyZh":"压疮风险由受压时间、组织耐受性、潮湿、营养和活动能力共同决定。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
