皮肤，再完成摆位和记录。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":true,"controlSentenceEn":"The client is incontinent and due for repositioning.","controlSentenceZh":"患者失禁且到了变换体位时间。"}
{"queueIndex":1544,"bankPath":"banks/gpt-canonical.json","bankSha256":"61664a6bef854ec8d7a3a0113779a4773135724aabfdec65b970b7ac6464c5d2","topLevelQuestionId":"gpt_gap_2026_06_12_nonmcq_balanced_case_pressure_injury_nutrition_03","embeddedQuestionId":"gpt_gap_2026_06_12_nonmcq_balanced_case_pressure_injury_nutrition_03_q4","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.243.caseStudy.questions.3","itemType":"select_all","category":"Basic Care and Comfort","topic":"Mobility & Immobility","difficulty":"medium","ngnSkill":"generate_solutions","stemPathEn":"questions.243.caseStudy.questions.3.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.243.caseStudy.questions.3.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[111,133],"terminalOffsetsZh":[35,43],"fullStemEn":"Stage 2 notes show the sacral redness persists. Which actions should the nurse include in the prevention plan? Select all that apply.","fullStemZh":"第 2 阶段记录显示骶尾部红斑持续存在。护士应将哪些措施纳入预防计划？选择所有适用项。","terminalSentenceEn":"Select all that apply.","terminalSentenceZh":"选择所有适用项。","penultimateSentenceEn":"Which actions should the nurse include in the prevention plan?","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士应将哪些措施纳入预防计划？","responseContext":{"type":"select_all","options":[{"id":"D","en":"Request high-protein nutrition supplementation if appropriate","zh":"适当时申请高蛋白营养补充"},{"id":"C","en":"Massage the reddened sacrum to increase circulation","zh":"按摩发红骶尾部以增加循环"},{"id":"A","en":"Reposition at scheduled intervals and after soiling","zh":"按计划间隔及污染后变换体位"},{"id":"F","en":"Place a donut cushion under the sacrum","zh":"在骶尾部下方放置环形垫"},{"id":"E","en":"Use moisture barrier after each incontinence episode","zh":"每次失禁后使用防潮屏障"},{"id":"B","en":"Float heels off the mattress with pillows or heel protectors","zh":"用枕头或足跟保护器使足跟悬空减压"}],"correct":["A","B","D","E"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Pressure injury prevention includes repositioning, heel offloading, moisture management, nutrition support, and minimizing shear. Massage over a reddened bony prominence and donut cushions are avoided.","rationaleCorrectZh":"压疮预防包括变换体位、足跟减压、湿度管理、营养支持和减少剪切力。应避免按摩发红骨突处和使用环形垫。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Select interventions that remove pressure, reduce moisture, and improve tissue tolerance; reject actions that increase focal pressure or trauma.","testTakingStrategyZh":"选择能减压、减少潮湿、改善组织耐受性的措施；排除增加局部压力或创伤的措施。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
