{"queueIndex":2300,"bankPath":"banks/hard-cases-canonical.json","bankSha256":"438c176897a41d3b7f212435e5945bd524c3f0ba5a62931eb5e85843c93d8730","topLevelQuestionId":"case_ami_01","embeddedQuestionId":"case_ami_01_q3","recordKind":"EMBEDDED_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.8.caseStudy.questions.2","itemType":"select_all","category":"Pharmacological and Parenteral Therapies","topic":"Medication Safety & Admin","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.8.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.8.caseStudy.questions.2.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[140,162],"terminalOffsetsZh":[40,45],"fullStemEn":"Before the client becomes hypotensive and if no contraindications are present, which medications may be anticipated for initial STEMI care? Select all that apply.","fullStemZh":"在患者发生低血压之前且无禁忌证时，急性 STEMI 初始处理可能会使用哪些药物？多项选择。","terminalSentenceEn":"Select all that apply.","terminalSentenceZh":"多项选择。","penultimateSentenceEn":"Before the client becomes hypotensive and if no contraindications are present, which medications may be anticipated for initial STEMI care?","penultimateSentenceZh":"在患者发生低血压之前且无禁忌证时，急性 STEMI 初始处理可能会使用哪些药物？","responseContext":{"type":"select_all","options":[{"id":"C","en":"Morphine","zh":"吗啡"},{"id":"B","en":"Clopidogrel","zh":"氯吡格雷"},{"id":"E","en":"Warfarin","zh":"华法林"},{"id":"D","en":"Nitroglycerin","zh":"硝酸甘油"},{"id":"A","en":"Aspirin","zh":"阿司匹林"}],"correct":["A","B","C","D"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Initial STEMI care commonly includes immediate antiplatelet therapy with aspirin plus a P2Y12 inhibitor. Nitroglycerin may be used for ischemic chest pain if not contraindicated, and morphine may be used for severe or persistent ischemic pain when appropriate. Warfarin is not used for acute STEMI stabilization.","rationaleCorrectZh":"STEMI 初始处理通常包括立即给予阿司匹林联合 P2Y12 抑制剂的抗血小板治疗。无禁忌证时可用硝酸甘油缓解缺血性胸痛；对严重或持续性缺血性疼痛，必要时可使用吗啡。华法林不用于急性 STEMI 的初始稳定处理。","testTakingStrategyEn":"For ACS medication items, pair core antiplatelet therapy with contraindication screening for symptom-relief medications.","testTakingStrategyZh":"遇到 ACS 用药题时，将核心抗血小板治疗与症状缓解药物的禁忌证筛查结合起来判断。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
