{"queueIndex":2303,"bankPath":"banks/hard-cases-canonical.json","bankSha256":"438c176897a41d3b7f212435e5945bd524c3f0ba5a62931eb5e85843c93d8730","topLevelQuestionId":"sa_ped_dehydration_01","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.9","itemType":"matrix","category":"Physiological Adaptation","topic":"Renal & Gastrointestinal Disorders","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.9.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.9.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[72,122],"terminalOffsetsZh":[20,33],"fullStemEn":"A 2-year-old child is brought to the clinic with vomiting and diarrhea. The nurse assesses the child's dehydration status.","fullStemZh":"一名 2 岁儿童因呕吐和腹泻被送到诊所。护士评估该儿童的脱水程度。","terminalSentenceEn":"The nurse assesses the child's dehydration status.","terminalSentenceZh":"护士评估该儿童的脱水程度。","penultimateSentenceEn":"A 2-year-old child is brought to the clinic with vomiting and diarrhea.","penultimateSentenceZh":"一名 2 岁儿童因呕吐和腹泻被送到诊所。","responseContext":{"type":"matrix","matrix":{"rows":[{"id":"r1","en":"Delayed capillary refill (> 4 sec), tenting skin turgor","zh":"毛细血管充盈时间延迟 (> 4 秒)，皮肤弹性呈帐篷状"},{"id":"r2","en":"Dry mucous membranes, slightly sunken eyes, mild tachycardia","zh":"黏膜干燥，眼窝轻度凹陷，轻度心动过速"},{"id":"r3","en":"Slightly dry mucous membranes, increased thirst","zh":"粘膜轻微干燥，口渴增加"}],"columns":[{"id":"c2","en":"Moderate Dehydration","zh":"中度脱水"},{"id":"c3","en":"Severe Dehydration","zh":"重度脱水"},{"id":"c1","en":"Mild Dehydration","zh":"轻度脱水"}],"selectionMode":"single_per_row"},"correct":[{"rowId":"r1","columnIds":["c3"]},{"rowId":"r2","columnIds":["c2"]},{"rowId":"r3","columnIds":["c1"]}]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Severe dehydration presents with significantly delayed capillary refill (> 4 sec) and skin tenting. Moderate dehydration features dry mucous membranes, slightly sunken eyes, and tachycardia. Mild dehydration may show only increased thirst or slightly dry membranes.","rationaleCorrectZh":"重度脱水表现为毛细血管充盈时间显著延迟（超过 4 秒）和皮肤弹性呈帐篷状改变。中度脱水表现为黏膜干燥、眼窝轻度凹陷以及心动过速。轻度脱水可能仅表现为口渴增加或黏膜轻度干燥。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Focus on capillary refill and skin turgor as key indicators of severity.","testTakingStrategyZh":"重点关注毛细血管充盈和皮肤弹性作为严重程度的关键指标。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":2304,"bankPath":"banks/hard-cases-canonical.json","bankSha256":"438c176897a41d3b7f212435e5945bd524c3f0ba5a62931eb5e85843c93d8730","topLevelQuestionId":"sa_vap_prevention_01","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.10","itemType":"dropdown_cloze","category":"Safety and Infection Prevention and Control","topic":"Standard Precautions & Hygiene","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.10.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.10.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[0,100],"terminalOffsetsZh":[0,34],"fullStemEn":"The nurse is caring for a client on mechanical ventilation and implements the VAP prevention bundle.","fullStemZh":"护士正在护理一名使用机械通气的患者，并实施 VAP 预防集束化措施。","terminalSentenceEn":"The nurse is caring for a client on mechanical ventilation and implements the VAP prevention bundle.","terminalSentenceZh":"护士正在护理一名使用机械通气的患者，并实施 VAP 预防集束化措施。","penultimateSentenceEn":null,"penultimateSentenceZh":null,"responseContext":{"type":"dropdown_cloze","clozeStem":{"en":"To prevent VAP, the head of the bed should be maintained at {{1}} degrees, and oral care should include {{2}}.","zh":"为了预防 VAP，床头应保持在 {{1}} 度，口腔护理应包括 {{2}}。"},"dropdowns":[{"id":"1","options":[{"id":"o1","en":"10-20","zh":"10-20"},{"id":"o2","en":"30-45","zh":"30-45"}],"correct":"o2"},{"id":"2","options":[{"id":"o2","en":"Lemon glycerin swabs","zh":"柠檬甘油棉签"},{"id":"o1","en":"toothbrushing-based oral care","zh":"以刷牙为主的口腔护理"}],"correct":"o1"}]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Updated VAP prevention strategies emphasize head-of-bed elevation and routine toothbrushing-based oral care. Lemon glycerin swabs are not an evidence-based VAP prevention substitute.","rationaleCorrectZh":"更新的 VAP 预防策略强调床头抬高和常规以刷牙为主的口腔护理。柠檬甘油棉签不能替代循证的 VAP 预防性口腔护理。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Identify evidence-based bundle components for ventilator care.","testTakingStrategyZh":"识别机械通气护理中基于证据的集束化组件。","sourceMetadata":null,"