{"queueIndex":2309,"bankPath":"banks/hard-cases-canonical.json","bankSha256":"438c176897a41d3b7f212435e5945bd524c3f0ba5a62931eb5e85843c93d8730","topLevelQuestionId":"sa_thyroid_storm_01","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.15","itemType":"select_all","category":"Physiological Adaptation","topic":"Endocrine & Neurological Disorders","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.15.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.15.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[106,128],"terminalOffsetsZh":[27,32],"fullStemEn":"A client is admitted with suspected thyroid storm. Which clinical manifestations should the nurse expect? Select all that apply.","fullStemZh":"一名患者因疑似甲状腺危象入院。护士应预期哪些临床表现？多项选择。","terminalSentenceEn":"Select all that apply.","terminalSentenceZh":"多项选择。","penultimateSentenceEn":"Which clinical manifestations should the nurse expect?","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士应预期哪些临床表现？","responseContext":{"type":"select_all","options":[{"id":"B","en":"Severe tachycardia","zh":"严重心动过速"},{"id":"C","en":"Bradycardia and cold intolerance","zh":"心动过缓和怕冷"},{"id":"D","en":"Agitation and delirium","zh":"焦虑不安和谵妄"},{"id":"A","en":"Hyperpyrexia","zh":"超高热"},{"id":"E","en":"Exophthalmos","zh":"突眼"}],"correct":["A","B","D"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Thyroid storm is an extreme hypermetabolic state characterized by high fever, severe tachycardia, and CNS agitation or delirium. Bradycardia and cold intolerance suggest hypothyroidism. Exophthalmos is a feature of Graves disease but is not diagnostic of the acute storm state.","rationaleCorrectZh":"甲状腺危象是一种极度高代谢状态，特征包括高热、严重心动过速以及中枢神经系统兴奋或谵妄。心动过缓和怕冷更提示甲状腺功能减退。突眼是格雷夫斯病的特征，但不是急性危象状态的诊断依据。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Focus on extreme hypermetabolic symptoms.","testTakingStrategyZh":"重点关注极度高代谢症状。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTerminalRepeatedElsewhereInItem":false},"controlSelected":false,"controlSentenceEn":null,"controlSentenceZh":null}
{"queueIndex":2310,"bankPath":"banks/hard-cases-canonical.json","bankSha256":"438c176897a41d3b7f212435e5945bd524c3f0ba5a62931eb5e85843c93d8730","topLevelQuestionId":"sa_post_mortem_01","embeddedQuestionId":null,"recordKind":"TOP_LEVEL_SCORED_LEAF","questionPath":"questions.16","itemType":"ordered_response","category":"Basic Care and Comfort","topic":"Palliative & Supportive Care","difficulty":"hard","ngnSkill":null,"stemPathEn":"questions.16.stem.en","stemPathZh":"questions.16.stem.zh","segmentationMethod":"Intl.Segmenter","segmentationConfidence":"HIGH","terminalOffsetsEn":[42,79],"terminalOffsetsZh":[11,22],"fullStemEn":"The nurse is performing post-mortem care. Place the steps in the correct order.","fullStemZh":"护士正在进行尸体料理。按正确的顺序排列步骤。","terminalSentenceEn":"Place the steps in the correct order.","terminalSentenceZh":"按正确的顺序排列步骤。","penultimateSentenceEn":"The nurse is performing post-mortem care.","penultimateSentenceZh":"护士正在进行尸体料理。","responseContext":{"type":"ordered_response","options":[{"id":"B","en":"Remove tubes and dressings (unless autopsy is required)","zh":"移除导管和敷料（除非需要尸检）"},{"id":"D","en":"Allow family privacy with the deceased","zh":"允许家属与死者单独相处"},{"id":"C","en":"Wash the body and place a clean gown","zh":"清洗尸体并穿上干净的衣服"},{"id":"A","en":"Close the eyes and position the head on a pillow","zh":"闭合双眼并将头部置于枕头上"}],"correct":["A","B","C","D"]},"rationaleCorrectEn":"Positioning prevents pooling of blood (livor mortis) in the face. Cleaning and removing tubes (if allowed) follows before family viewing.","rationaleCorrectZh":"体位放置可防止面部血液淤积（尸斑）。在让家属见最后一面之前，先进行清洁和移除导管（如果允许）。","testTakingStrategyEn":"Think about the aesthetic appearance of the deceased for the family.","testTakingStrategyZh":"考虑死者在家属面前的美学外观。","sourceMetadata":null,"mechanicalSignals":{"rawPlaceholderInStem":false,"terminalContainsRawPlaceholder":false,"terminalBeginsThisItemOrQuestion":false,"terminalMentionsLearnerExpectation":false,"terminalFollowsExplicitResponseDemand":false,"exactEnglishTermi